// Name :
"P2060199557" "Silver Mantis"
// ProfessionString :
"P3934921355" "Black Scorpion's Bad Girl"
// DescriptionString :
"P1255659319" "Tamura Shirai is fascinated with the smooth, sleek feel of metal. Funding the augmentation of her body to pure metal was an expensive proposition, however, so she turned to crime. During one of her robberies she encountered Black Scorpion, on a job for Lord Recluse. Tamura realized an opportunity when she saw it, and rather than fighting with Arachnos over the ill-gotten loot, formed an alliance that has lasted to this day."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3599831885" "Colonel Virgil Duray, the leader of those pathetic paramilitary renegades known as the Sky Raiders, has hatched a plan to vault his little band of mercenary misfits to the top again. They plan to plunder enhancement technologies, drugs, and even some minor magics from every group they can. They just made one mistake: They didn't clear this desperate little power-grab with Arachnos. So now they have to fail. <br><br>Lord Recluse has asked Black Scorpion to handle it, and he's authorized me to create a task force of whomever I see fit. So I'm looking for mercenaries, killers, madmen, and murderers who can get the job done and crush the Colonel Duray's little plan."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P1097431028" "You shouldn't waste my time, you worthless piece of trash. You're so weak I wouldn't even get off on killing you now. Come back when you're at least level {Level}, and maybe then you can come out and play."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P970317709" "So, you've earned a threat level rating of {Level} now? Should I be impressed? Too bad. You've overdone it. You're threat level is over 25 now, and that puts you outside the range for this operation, and off the list. Well, I'm sure you can find something else to do. <br><br>It's too bad, really. I wanted to watch the way you destroy."
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P1103677421" "Send your team's leader to me. Unless they're afraid."
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P103405422" "You need to get at least a team of 4 for this. Much as I like watching weaklings die, this needs to have a at least a chance of success, or Black Scorpion will get mad that I send you to your death. ."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P2157014551" "Get everyone in your little team together, and bring them to me. I want to see what kind of killers you are."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P3376614323" "Someone on your team isn't threat level {Level}. Their weakness is holding you back."
// TaskForceName :
"P954212561" "Strike Force Buzzsaw"
// TaskForceName :
"P2176426895" "Strike Force Bonesaw"
